  data: {
    LLM: "Bid cautiously. Going Alone is very risky unless you have 6-7 trumps and side Aces. In a partnership bid, signal your partner by leading trumps early.\n\nThe 'Hearts' Premium: Since Hearts are worth double (or rank higher), aggressive bidding in Hearts can shut out opponents who have strong Spades hands.\n\nDefending a Solo: Lead through the Soloist's weakness. If they are void in Clubs, lead Clubs to force a trump. If they lead trumps, hold your winner until the end.",
